OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMasked robbers jailed over #13k
OL,4,Aphone thefts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair fled with the phones after the
OL,7,Frobbery on 3 May, but were later
OL,8,Fidentified through CCTV footage,
OL,9,Fautomatic number plate recognition data
OL,10,Fand mobile phone analysis, Surrey
OL,11,FPolice said.
OL,13,FThey both pleaded guilty to robbery.
OL,14,FFaal was jailed for three years and
OL,15,FCarey-Nichols was sentenced to
OL,16,Ftwo-and-a-half years at Guildford Crown
OL,17,FCourt on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
